e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +3 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1972","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-miami-dolphins","name":"Miami Dolphins","code":"MIA","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 61)","str":85.3,"squad":[["Earl Morrall","QB",80],["Bob Griese","QB",73],["Mercury Morris","RB",89],["Larry Csonka","RB",88],["Paul Warfield","WR",80],["Howard Twilley","WR",77],["Marlin Briscoe","WR",73],["Otto Stowe","WR",72],["Marv Fleming","TE",77],["Jim Mandich","TE",65],["Bob Kuechenberg","OL",99],["Jim Langer","OL",99],["Larry Little","OL",99],["Norm Evans","OL",99],["Doug Crusan","OL",67],["Wayne Moore","OL",64],["Al Jenkins","OL",57],["Vern Den Herder","DL",94],["Bill Stanfill","DL",93],["Manny Fernandez","DL",82],["Bob Heinz","DL",70],["Jim Dunaway","DL",67],["Maulty Moore","DL",61],["Doug Swift","LB",90],["Nick Buoniconti","LB",88],["Mike Kolen","LB",76],["Curtis Johnson","CB",83],["Tim Foley","CB",76],["Lloyd Mumphord","CB",68],["Charlie Babb","CB",63],["Dick Anderson","S",95],["Jake Scott","S",92],["Garo Yepremian","K",92]]},{"id":"nfl-san-francisco-49ers","name":"San Francisco 49ers","code":"SFO","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 43)","str":83.1,"squad":[["Steve Spurrier","QB",75],["John Brodie","QB",74],["Vic Washington","RB",85],["Ken Willard","RB",79],["Gene Washington","WR",99],["Preston Riley","WR",75],["Dick Witcher","WR",73],["Terry Beasley","WR",65],["Ted Kwalick","TE",99],["Forrest Blue","OL",91],["Len R